{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01JouCye9mnLEgut7fDspBKK","type":"tool_result","content":"/// Run `f` against the C library and then the Rust library and require the\n/// same message log, the same \"did it error out\" answer and the same result.\nfn diff<T, F>(label: &str, f: F)\nwhere\n    T: PartialEq + std::fmt::Debug,\n    F: Fn(&'static Library) -> T,\n{\n    ensure_libm();\n    let l = libs();\n    let a = capture_strict(|| f(&l.c));\n    let b = capture_strict(|| f(&l.rs));\n    if std::env::var_os(\"T_ERR2_TRACE\").is_some() {\n        eprintln!(\n            \"[C] {label} :: errored={} :: {}\",\n            a.out.is_none(),\n            a.log.iter().map(|m| m.to_string()).collect::<Vec<_>>().join(\" | \")\n        );\n    }\n    a.assert_eq(&b, label);\n}\n---\ntests:\ntotal 936\ndrwxr-xr-x. 3 scheschb amazon  16384 Sep  8 15:55 .\ndrwxr-xr-x. 6 scheschb amazon  16384 Sep  8 15:55 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x. 2 scheschb amazon     46 Sep  8 15:17 common\n-rw-r--r--. 1 scheschb amazon   1947 Sep  8 15:12 smoke.rs\n-rw-r--r--. 1 scheschb amazon 101247 Sep  8 15:43 t_err1.rs\n-rw-r--r--. 1 scheschb amazon 118353 Sep  8 15:56 t_err2.rs\n-rw-r--r--. 1 scheschb amazon  94681 Sep  8 15:55 t_err3.rs\n-rw-r--r--. 1 scheschb amazon  83178 Sep  8 15:47 t_err4.rs\n-rw-r--r--. 1 scheschb amazon  88999 Sep  8 15:45 t_err5.rs\n-rw-r--r--. 1 scheschb amazon  87492 Sep  8 15:42 t_mem.rs\n-rw-r--r--. 1 scheschb amazon  46083 Sep  8 15:32 t_pure.rs\n-rw-r--r--. 1 scheschb amazon 101501 Sep  8 15:56 t_read.rs\n-rw-r--r--. 1 scheschb amazon  30241 Sep  8 15:31 t_rowops.rs\n-rw-r--r--. 1 scheschb amazon  72897 Sep  8 15:43 t_simple.rs\n-rw-r--r--. 1 scheschb amazon  75307 Sep  8 15:36 t_write.rs\n\ntests/common:\ntotal 76\ndrwxr-xr-x. 2 scheschb amazon    46 Sep  8 15:17 .\ndrwxr-xr-x. 3 scheschb amazon 16384 Sep  8 15:55 ..\n-rw-r--r--. 1 scheschb amazon 34820 Sep  8 15:47 api.rs\n-rw-r--r--. 1 scheschb amazon 22570 Sep  8 15:47 mod.rs","is_err